flowchart TD
    A[Goal + Current State] --> B[Observe]
    B --> C[Orient / Analyze Gap]
    C --> D[Generate Options]
    D --> E{Decision}

    E -->|Continue| F[Execute Current Task Graph]
    E -->|Repair| G[Repair Failure]
    E -->|Refactor| H[Refactor Structure]
    E -->|Replan| I[Revise Plan]
    E -->|Redirect| J[Update Goal and Plan]
    E -->|Branch| K[Create New Version Branch]
    E -->|Rebirth| L[Propose Rebirth]
    E -->|Pause| M[Suspend Safely]
    E -->|Complete| N[Complete]

    F --> O[Verify]
    G --> O
    H --> O
    I --> C
    J --> C
    K --> C
    L --> P{User Confirms?}
    P -->|Yes| C
    P -->|No| I
    M --> Q[Resume / Redirect / Branch / Manual]
    Q --> C

    O --> R{Passed?}
    R -->|Yes| S[Commit / Checkpoint]
    R -->|No| D
    S --> T[Reflect]
    T --> C
